<title>THAILAND: Siam Cement Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>Siam Cement Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for six months ended June 30, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>			    Second quarter</p>
<p>				   1996			1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		13.15     vs	    10.67</p>
<p>    Net		    1,577.95     vs	 1,279.83</p>
<p>			     Six months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		20.39     vs	   20.07</p>
<p>    Net		    2,446.96     vs	2,408.53</p>
<p>NOTE: Revenues not stated.  </p>
<p>Company also reported consolidated profit for second quarter of 1.70 billion baht or 14.14 baht a share vs 1.68 billion baht or 13.99 per share for the same period last year. Consolidated net for the first six months totalled 4.34 billion baht or 36.13 per share vs 3.87 billion baht or 32.28 baht a share.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
